WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.020
Four prices. One candle.

2
00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:07.121
A candle summarizes the open, high, low, and close for one time period.

3
00:00:07.641 --> 00:00:08.419
The body.

4
00:00:08.539 --> 00:00:11.534
The body connects the opening and closing prices.

5
00:00:11.654 --> 00:00:13.489
It shows the net price change.

6
00:00:14.016 --> 00:00:14.713
The wicks.

7
00:00:14.833 --> 00:00:18.815
Thin lines extend to the highest and lowest prices reached during the period.

8
00:00:19.349 --> 00:00:20.371
Green and red.

9
00:00:20.491 --> 00:00:22.430
Green closes above the open.

10
00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:24.373
Red closes below the open.

11
00:00:24.493 --> 00:00:26.640
Neither color predicts the next candle.

12
00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:28.287
Try the LIVE view.

13
00:00:28.407 --> 00:00:31.309
Sprout LIVE candles cover 30 seconds each.

14
00:00:31.429 --> 00:00:34.517
Inspect a candle and compare its four prices.

